1
00:00:00,266 --> 00:00:02,736
This goddess almost wiped out humanity.

2
00:00:02,858 --> 00:00:03,870
And they stopped her…

3
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:04,670
with beer.

4
00:00:05,051 --> 00:00:05,985
Look up Hathor:

5
00:00:06,038 --> 00:00:07,652
goddess of love and music.

6
00:00:07,767 --> 00:00:09,425
But that label was stuck on her

7
00:00:09,236 --> 00:00:10,237
by the Greeks.

8
00:00:10,637 --> 00:00:12,657
In the Egyptian text, carved in the

9
00:00:12,468 --> 00:00:14,532
tomb of Seti the First, Ra has

10
00:00:14,343 --> 00:00:15,190
grown old.

11
00:00:15,335 --> 00:00:16,510
And humans mock him:

12
00:00:16,596 --> 00:00:18,989
bones of silver, flesh of gold, hair

13
00:00:18,799 --> 00:00:20,063
of lapis lazuli.

14
00:00:20,451 --> 00:00:22,010
So Ra sends out his Eye:

15
00:00:22,074 --> 00:00:22,635
Hathor.

16
00:00:22,769 --> 00:00:25,096
She hunts the blasphemers through the mountains,

17
00:00:25,105 --> 00:00:26,171
and kills them all.

18
00:00:26,554 --> 00:00:29,002
For three nights, now as Hathor Sekhmet,

19
00:00:29,032 --> 00:00:30,581
she wades in the blood of men.

20
00:00:30,966 --> 00:00:32,997
Ra regrets it, and sets a trap:

21
00:00:33,104 --> 00:00:35,464
seven thousand jars of beer, dyed red,

22
00:00:35,472 --> 00:00:36,900
poured out over the fields.

23
00:00:37,285 --> 00:00:40,281
Hathor drinks, gets very merry, falls asleep.

24
00:00:40,426 --> 00:00:41,623
And kills no more.

25
00:00:42,011 --> 00:00:44,404
Ever after, at every festival of Hathor,

26
00:00:44,445 --> 00:00:45,873
they brewed sleepy beer.

27
00:00:46,255 --> 00:00:47,902
Some call this a flood myth.

28
00:00:48,019 --> 00:00:49,951
But the only thing flooding the fields…

29
00:00:49,992 --> 00:00:50,730
is beer.

30
00:00:51,099 --> 00:00:53,360
Before you believe a myth, always ask:

31
00:00:53,412 --> 00:00:54,709
which text says so?

32
00:00:55,090 --> 00:00:57,066
Save it, and send it to anyone

33
00:00:56,877 --> 00:00:58,634
who thinks Hathor was just the goddess

34
00:00:58,445 --> 00:00:59,117
of love.

